<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka benchmark 12-month T-bills unchanged.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka benchmark 12-month T-bills unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yields of Sri Lanka's 12-month treasury bills remained unchanged while three-month yields rose by 0.07 percentage points and six-month yields by 0.02 at Wednesday's auction, the Central Bank said on Thursday.</p>
<p>		   Bids received   Bids accepted   Avg yield</p>
<p>    3 months     1,189	     1,099	  10.70 (10.63)</p>
<p>    6 months	 752		 492	  11.65 (11.63)</p>
<p>    12 months	672		 407	  12.74 (12.74)</p>
<p>    Total	  2,613	     1,998</p>
<p>NOTE - Bids in million rupees, yields in percent (previous week's yields in brackets).</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
